<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Chọn địa chỉ giao hàng</title>
  
  <!-- 1. THÊM CSS CỦA LEAFLET VÀO ĐÂY -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" integrity="sha256-p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyobQFXqwk/O21MQ=" crossorigin=""/><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" integrity="sha256-p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyobQFXqwk/O21MQ=" crossorigin=""/>

  <style>
    body, html {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      height: 100%;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f7f7f7;
    }

    #map {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100vh;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .leaflet-container img {
      max-width: none !important;
      margin: 0 !important;
      padding: 0 !important;
    }

    .map-card {
      position: fixed;
      top: 16px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.16);
      z-index: 1000;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ee4d2d;
    }

    .confirm-box {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      background: white;
      padding: 18px 20px 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 -8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.14);
      box-sizing: border-box;
      border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0;
      text-align: center;
      z-index: 1000;
    }

    .confirm-box h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #333;
    }

    #address-text {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #666;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      min-height: 20px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .location-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .btn-location,
    .btn-confirm {
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
      min-width: 170px;
    }

    .btn-location {
      background: #fff;
      color: #333;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .btn-location:hover,
    .btn-confirm:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .btn-confirm {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff7e5f, #ee4d2d);
      color: white;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 420px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(238,77,45,0.2);
    }

    .btn-back {
      position: fixed;
      top: 16px;
      left: 16px;
      background: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.16);
      cursor: pointer;
      z-index: 1000;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <button class="btn-back" onclick="window.history.back()">❮</button>
  <div class="map-card">📍 Chọn vị trí giao hàng</div>
  
  <div id="map"></div>

  <div class="confirm-box">
    <h3>Địa chỉ giao hàng của bạn:</h3>
    <p id="address-text">Nhấn vào bản đồ để chọn vị trí giao hàng.</p>
    <div class="location-actions">
      <button class="btn-location" id="btn-current-location">Định vị hiện tại</button>
      <button class="btn-confirm" id="btn-save-location">Xác nhận địa chỉ này</button>
    </div>
    <p id="hint-text" style="font-size:13px; color:#999; margin:12px 0 0;">Chỉ click chọn vị trí, hoặc dùng nút định vị nếu muốn lấy vị trí hiện tại.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- 2. THÊM SCRIPT CỦA LEAFLET (Đặt trước file location.js của bạn) -->
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js" integrity="sha256-20nQCchB9co0qIjJZRGuk2/Z9VM+kNiyxNV1lvTlZBo=" crossorigin=""></script>
  
  <!-- 3. QUAN TRỌNG: Đã xóa dòng script của Google Maps -->
  
  <script src="/js/location.js"></script>
</body>
</html>